1
00:00:56,296 --> 00:01:02,720
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:09,885 --> 00:01:12,646
I've always heard the court is a place of endless intrigue and chaos.

3
00:01:12,699 --> 00:01:14,659
I've been trying to survive here for a while now.

4
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:16,584
Most days, I feel lost and overwhelmed.

5
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:19,733
Father,

6
00:01:20,144 --> 00:01:21,677
when you joined the court back then,

7
00:01:23,047 --> 00:01:24,982
did you ever struggle a lot

8
00:01:26,005 --> 00:01:27,340
and feel like I do now?

9
00:01:27,472 --> 00:01:28,884
(Shen Qing Zhi's Grave)

10
00:01:28,965 --> 00:01:30,498
It's fine even if it's tough.

11
00:01:30,893 --> 00:01:33,184
After all, I'm the first Top Scholar from a humble family.

12
00:01:33,208 --> 00:01:34,502
Even if I die,

13
00:01:36,199 --> 00:01:37,774
they'll still carve

14
00:01:39,208 --> 00:01:41,063
a poem wilder than this

15
00:01:42,172 --> 00:01:43,960
on my tombstone one day.

16
00:01:50,712 --> 00:01:52,909
Breaking new ground, blazing the trail.

17
00:01:53,032 --> 00:01:55,160
Climbing high, outshining every scholar.

18
00:01:55,241 --> 00:01:57,494
Don't say only the rich have gifted sons.

19
00:01:57,626 --> 00:01:59,920
Even humble families can shine with brilliance.

20
00:02:00,375 --> 00:02:01,424
Censor Shen,

21
00:02:01,542 --> 00:02:03,117
is this wild enough for you?

22
00:02:05,255 --> 00:02:07,293
The winding Yellow River turns back its waves.

23
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,680
Washing away centuries of noble sand.

24
00:02:10,671 --> 00:02:12,640
Kunlun becomes a pen to reach the heavens.

25
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:16,013
Dipping in silver to write the humble family's story.

26
00:02:20,976 --> 00:02:22,549
Guess I was thinking too small.

27
00:02:22,912 --> 00:02:24,468
I didn't think you would

28
00:02:24,549 --> 00:02:26,547
stand up for all the poor families, Censor Shen.

29
00:02:26,711 --> 00:02:27,964
It's what I should do.

30
00:02:28,761 --> 00:02:29,975
Reckless fool.

31
00:02:30,503 --> 00:02:32,560
Your Highness, what brings you here?

32
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,720
I'm here to pay respects to someone who passed.

33
00:02:41,191 --> 00:02:43,679
Three years ago, I supervised the construction of Qianfo Temple.

34
00:02:43,703 --> 00:02:45,640
I met your father a few times back then.

35
00:02:55,384 --> 00:02:57,660
A minor eighth-rank official like you

36
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,560
thinks you can impeach me?

37
00:03:01,192 --> 00:03:02,645
You really don't know your place.

38
00:03:03,096 --> 00:03:05,349
Using temple construction as a cover

39
00:03:05,528 --> 00:03:07,471
to seize land from the people.

40
00:03:07,576 --> 00:03:09,875
Crown Prince, do you think

41
00:03:10,072 --> 00:03:12,600
no one will ever know what you did if you kill me?

42
00:03:19,656 --> 00:03:21,240
Seizing land and hoarding grain

43
00:03:21,504 --> 00:03:23,080
is as serious as treason

44
00:03:23,297 --> 00:03:24,872
under the Law of Ye.

45
00:03:25,042 --> 00:03:26,857
Your Highness, you'd better stop before it's too late.

46
00:03:26,881 --> 00:03:28,095
Stop?

47
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:32,853
Father let my brother take charge of the Ministry of Revenue.

48
00:03:33,279 --> 00:03:35,520
He probably wants to change the heir.

49
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,720
But this could bring trouble down the line.

50
00:03:37,771 --> 00:03:39,461
I knew this day would come.

51
00:03:39,542 --> 00:03:41,600
That's why I pushed Zhao Yang forward.

52
00:03:43,799 --> 00:03:45,414
Construction of this Qianfo Temple

53
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:50,520
was supervised by Zhao Yang

54
00:03:50,651 --> 00:03:52,771
because she stepped up to ease His Majesty's worries.

55
00:03:57,708 --> 00:03:59,042
The greater good comes first.

56
00:04:00,088 --> 00:04:01,742
When there's no other choice,

57
00:04:03,009 --> 00:04:04,903
someone always has to take the fall.

58
00:04:06,708 --> 00:04:08,441
That person can't be me,

59
00:04:10,208 --> 00:04:11,903
and it won't be you.

60
00:04:14,487 --> 00:04:15,804
Only Zhao Yang,

61
00:04:15,912 --> 00:04:17,629
that child born to a servant,

62
00:04:17,710 --> 00:04:19,244
is the perfect choice.

63
00:04:21,583 --> 00:04:23,677
I understand.

64
00:04:25,312 --> 00:04:27,327
Hurry up and bury him. Make it look clean.

65
00:04:27,526 --> 00:04:28,821
Don't leave any traces.

66
00:04:35,448 --> 00:04:38,381
He was a lean man with an unyielding spirit.

67
00:04:38,625 --> 00:04:40,279
A rare, honest official.

68
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:42,823
Sadly, he died in a fall off a cliff.

69
00:04:42,847 --> 00:04:44,222
No remains were ever found.

70
00:04:44,537 --> 00:04:46,070
It's really a shame.

71
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,160
I don't get it.

72
00:04:51,708 --> 00:04:53,026
My father was just

73
00:04:53,125 --> 00:04:55,299
an eighth-rank clerk in the Ministry of Revenue.

74
00:04:56,698 --> 00:04:58,751
He just copied documents every day.

75
00:04:59,333 --> 00:05:01,748
Why would he fall off a cliff at Qianfo Temple?

76
00:05:02,565 --> 00:05:04,659
You think Clerk Shen's death

77
00:05:05,169 --> 00:05:06,623
wasn't an accident?

78
00:05:06,822 --> 00:05:08,622
Your Highness, you know what really happened,

79
00:05:09,783 --> 00:05:10,997
don't you?

80
00:05:14,521 --> 00:05:15,776
All I know is

81
00:05:16,327 --> 00:05:18,182
that Clerk Shen was a good official.

82
00:05:18,667 --> 00:05:20,920
He had a backbone and never bowed to power.

83
00:05:21,369 --> 00:05:22,982
Like father, like son.

84
00:05:23,648 --> 00:05:27,614
I'm sure you won't dishonor that spirit.

85
00:05:29,688 --> 00:05:31,982
Your Highness once told me to leave the Censorate.

86
00:05:32,568 --> 00:05:33,821
Yesterday, the second prince helped me out,

87
00:05:33,845 --> 00:05:35,725
and invited me to join the Ministry of Revenue.

88
00:05:36,008 --> 00:05:37,823
Today, you came to tell me

89
00:05:38,135 --> 00:05:40,720
my father's death was suspicious.

90
00:05:41,346 --> 00:05:43,640
Are you working for the Second Prince, Your Highness?

91
00:05:44,664 --> 00:05:47,159
Are you trying to use me to bring down the Crown Prince,

92
00:05:47,615 --> 00:05:49,615
so you can help the Second Prince take the throne?

93
00:05:51,404 --> 00:05:53,660
You're talking nonsense.

94
00:05:54,279 --> 00:05:55,797
Do you know how dangerous it is

95
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,494
to go up against the Crown Prince?

96
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,734
Danger doesn't scare me.

97
00:06:05,458 --> 00:06:07,455
Three years ago, when Qianfo Temple was finished,

98
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,096
a good omen appeared in the sky.

99
00:06:09,231 --> 00:06:10,711
Buddha's light shone over everything.

100
00:06:11,042 --> 00:06:12,256
This Buddha's light

101
00:06:12,544 --> 00:06:14,357
can bless all living beings,

102
00:06:15,815 --> 00:06:17,029
and surely,

103
00:06:17,674 --> 00:06:19,568
it can light the path for the righteous.

104
00:06:19,848 --> 00:06:21,341
Heaven's will is clear.

105
00:06:21,656 --> 00:06:22,990
Justice never fades.

106
00:06:24,983 --> 00:06:27,040
The way you stand fearless against the world

107
00:06:27,167 --> 00:06:28,800
is pretty likable.

108
00:06:29,972 --> 00:06:33,160
Censor Shen, do you want to join the Ministry of Revenue?

109
00:06:38,417 --> 00:06:39,992
Please help me, Your Highness.

110
00:06:41,719 --> 00:06:43,280
I can't help you.

111
00:06:43,727 --> 00:06:45,381
But allow me to give you a reminder.

112
00:06:45,752 --> 00:06:47,070
The Crown Prince

113
00:06:47,181 --> 00:06:49,434
is hosting a banquet for all the Censorate officials today.

114
00:06:49,458 --> 00:06:50,992
No banquet is ever truly friendly.

115
00:06:51,263 --> 00:06:53,080
Censor Shen, you'd better be careful.

116
00:07:07,032 --> 00:07:08,668
Second Brother wants someone from me.

117
00:07:08,767 --> 00:07:11,049
He wants to transfer Shen Xiao to the Ministry of Revenue.

118
00:07:11,073 --> 00:07:12,240
I...

119
00:07:15,250 --> 00:07:16,543
I can't bear to let him go.

120
00:07:17,239 --> 00:07:18,680
Rest assured, Your Highness.

121
00:07:18,904 --> 00:07:21,360
I won't let him transfer to the Ministry of Revenue.

122
00:07:21,543 --> 00:07:24,300
This poor top scholar hasn't suffered enough at the Censorate yet.

123
00:07:24,381 --> 00:07:26,080
How can we let him go so easily?

124
00:07:27,799 --> 00:07:30,133
Exactly. There's no rush.

125
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:33,520
Censor Shen Xiao has arrived.

126
00:07:48,864 --> 00:07:50,237
I, Shen Xiao,

127
00:07:51,239 --> 00:07:53,396
greet the Crown Prince.

128
00:07:53,526 --> 00:07:54,698
Greetings to the Crown Princess.

129
00:07:54,722 --> 00:07:55,812
Greetings to all officials.

130
00:07:55,893 --> 00:07:57,088
Official Shen,

131
00:07:58,089 --> 00:08:00,474
I invited the heads of the three judicial offices today

132
00:08:00,656 --> 00:08:02,909
because I wanted to welcome you to the Censorate.

133
00:08:03,512 --> 00:08:04,726
But unexpectedly,

134
00:08:04,928 --> 00:08:06,965
you're in high demand as the new Top Scholar.

135
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:10,040
Before you even joined, the Ministry of Revenue already asked me for you.

136
00:08:14,706 --> 00:08:16,746
This recent tribute from Jiangnan, Yutangchun Wine,

137
00:08:17,396 --> 00:08:19,600
is rare for someone from a humble family.

138
00:08:20,295 --> 00:08:23,120
Today, you should drink a few more cups.

139
00:08:26,504 --> 00:08:28,102
Thank you, Your Highness, for the banquet.

140
00:08:28,126 --> 00:08:29,400
But in my opinion,

141
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:31,760
the value of wine isn't about where it's from,

142
00:08:31,922 --> 00:08:33,680
but who drinks it.

143
00:08:35,859 --> 00:08:37,504
Censor Shen, you are new here.

144
00:08:37,667 --> 00:08:41,038
You probably don't know that you have to drink this wine by the rules.

145
00:09:06,417 --> 00:09:08,790
When you toast the officials, you have to be sincere.

146
00:09:09,143 --> 00:09:11,120
Censor Shen, you need to use this bowl

147
00:09:11,310 --> 00:09:12,920
to toast everyone here.

148
00:09:13,093 --> 00:09:15,440
Three bowls for each person. Three rounds in total.

149
00:09:15,578 --> 00:09:18,390
Drink until the wine is gone, and that will show your sincerity.

150
00:09:19,566 --> 00:09:20,720
That's right.

151
00:09:21,088 --> 00:09:22,840
Censor Shen, if you can pull it off,

152
00:09:22,983 --> 00:09:24,960
it proves you have a strong will.

153
00:09:25,164 --> 00:09:27,644
Then, you can be sent to the Ministry of Revenue for training.

154
00:09:28,704 --> 00:09:30,280
I might consider it.

155
00:09:30,542 --> 00:09:32,236
(Senior officials of the court)

156
00:09:32,375 --> 00:09:34,855
(actually use these petty tricks to make things hard for him.)

157
00:09:35,013 --> 00:09:36,467
(How embarrassing.)

158
00:09:36,958 --> 00:09:38,880
(So, how will you break through?)

159
00:09:39,839 --> 00:09:41,293
Since it's the rule,

160
00:09:42,083 --> 00:09:44,280
I'll follow it.

161
00:09:57,824 --> 00:09:59,559
A toast to the Crown Prince.

162
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,720
A toast to the Crown Princess.

163
00:10:02,175 --> 00:10:03,600
And a toast to Ye Dynasty.

164
00:10:03,805 --> 00:10:05,925
May the country prosper and the people live in peace.

165
00:10:25,016 --> 00:10:26,830
Censor Shen, you can really hold your liquor.

166
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,480
Official Zhao, cheers.

167
00:10:49,583 --> 00:10:52,200
Censor Shen, you need a reason for each toast.

168
00:10:52,407 --> 00:10:54,688
- For this first bowl... - Of course, there's a reason.

169
00:10:54,827 --> 00:10:56,599
Official Zhao, why not hear mine first?

170
00:10:56,972 --> 00:10:59,376
Zhao Guang Ming, the Minister of Justice, loves antiques.

171
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,377
Last year, he secretly kept a famous painting.

172
00:11:01,458 --> 00:11:02,935
"River Sails After the Snow."

173
00:11:03,016 --> 00:11:05,149
"River Sails After the Snow."

174
00:11:05,696 --> 00:11:08,191
I heard this treasure has been lost for ages.

175
00:11:08,359 --> 00:11:11,240
It was stolen from the Crown Prince's tribute.

176
00:11:13,422 --> 00:11:16,400
Even the Crown Prince has never seen the real thing.

177
00:11:17,583 --> 00:11:20,326
But I heard this priceless treasure

178
00:11:20,425 --> 00:11:21,968
is at your residence, Official Zhao.

179
00:11:22,250 --> 00:11:23,503
So, this cup of wine

180
00:11:24,398 --> 00:11:26,999
is a toast to Official Zhao for your refined taste.

181
00:11:27,115 --> 00:11:28,521
Censor Shen, you must be joking.

182
00:11:28,630 --> 00:11:30,298
You're flattering me.

183
00:11:43,042 --> 00:11:44,256
Minister Qian.

184
00:11:44,983 --> 00:11:47,060
Censor Shen, you already serve alongside us

185
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:49,477
at a young age.

186
00:11:49,575 --> 00:11:51,560
But here in the court,

187
00:11:51,641 --> 00:11:55,855
you still have a lot to learn.

188
00:11:56,201 --> 00:11:58,374
I do have a lot to learn.

189
00:11:59,688 --> 00:12:03,284
I have to learn about how meticulous you were

190
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:04,960
when you renovated the Eastern Palace's villa.

191
00:12:04,984 --> 00:12:06,651
After all that careful planning,

192
00:12:06,732 --> 00:12:10,505
300 bolts of silk out of 500 bolts were left over.

193
00:12:10,828 --> 00:12:12,800
All of them ended up in his family's silk shop.

194
00:12:12,881 --> 00:12:14,975
Those extra bolts of silk in the shop

195
00:12:15,167 --> 00:12:17,540
must be selling pretty well, right?

196
00:12:23,433 --> 00:12:24,840
You're right.

197
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,214
Yes.

198
00:12:36,917 --> 00:12:38,131
Vice Censor-in-Chief Xiao.

199
00:12:41,136 --> 00:12:42,573
Xiao Jiang loves Jiangnan gardens.

200
00:12:42,654 --> 00:12:46,388
Jiangnan gardens are your passion.

201
00:12:46,927 --> 00:12:48,262
I've heard

202
00:12:48,504 --> 00:12:51,197
there's a rockery worth 50,000 taels

203
00:12:51,457 --> 00:12:54,573
in your Cuiwei Villa outside the capital.

204
00:12:54,695 --> 00:12:56,840
All the expenses for Cuiwei Billa

205
00:12:56,921 --> 00:12:59,157
came from the public road repair funds.

206
00:12:59,319 --> 00:13:01,680
That's a full 50,000 taels.

207
00:13:06,667 --> 00:13:10,601
A toast to Vice Censor-in-Chief Xiao for serving the country

208
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,158
and still finding time to enjoy

209
00:13:12,250 --> 00:13:13,944
the beauty of nature.

210
00:13:15,577 --> 00:13:17,431
Censor Shen, you sure know everything.

211
00:13:17,750 --> 00:13:20,240
I really don't deserve such praise.

212
00:13:20,542 --> 00:13:21,756
I don't deserve it.

213
00:13:32,583 --> 00:13:34,463
Official Shen, you can really hold your liquor.

214
00:13:37,319 --> 00:13:39,560
- Official Chen. - (Censor Chen.)

215
00:13:40,342 --> 00:13:42,699
- Official Liao. - (Censor Liao.)

216
00:13:44,708 --> 00:13:47,173
- Official Li. - (Censor Li.)

217
00:13:57,885 --> 00:13:59,138
A toast to you.

218
00:14:14,548 --> 00:14:15,760
Your Highness.

219
00:14:18,333 --> 00:14:19,547
Prince Consort Cui,

220
00:14:19,908 --> 00:14:21,642
this cup is for you.

221
00:14:22,536 --> 00:14:23,880
What about Cui Jin Zhi?

222
00:14:23,973 --> 00:14:26,240
Does Cui Jin Zhi have any secrets?

223
00:14:27,083 --> 00:14:29,416
Cui Jin Zhi has been the Crown Prince's study companion since childhood.

224
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,499
He's skilled in civil and military arts.

225
00:14:30,523 --> 00:14:32,500
I've long heard about how you excel in both arts

226
00:14:32,583 --> 00:14:34,747
and grew up by the Crown Prince's side as a study companion.

227
00:14:34,771 --> 00:14:36,386
You always act with discipline.

228
00:14:36,917 --> 00:14:39,477
You're one of the best among the younger generation of generals.

229
00:14:39,984 --> 00:14:42,717
Are you saying that this person is completely flawless?

230
00:14:42,798 --> 00:14:44,360
Everything I said is true.

231
00:14:44,469 --> 00:14:47,021
Censor Shen, you really know me well.

232
00:14:48,208 --> 00:14:49,422
You're too kind.

233
00:14:50,042 --> 00:14:53,000
What I said was just the truth.

234
00:15:05,672 --> 00:15:08,038
Gentlemen, by tradition,

235
00:15:08,254 --> 00:15:10,600
we should have another drink.

236
00:15:14,106 --> 00:15:17,120
Your Highness, I suddenly feel unwell.

237
00:15:18,105 --> 00:15:20,600
I'm afraid I can't drink this wine anymore.

238
00:15:22,496 --> 00:15:24,509
Your Highness, I...

239
00:15:26,165 --> 00:15:28,019
My old illness has flared up again.

240
00:15:28,911 --> 00:15:31,045
Please forgive me, Your Highness. I...

241
00:15:31,208 --> 00:15:34,182
I'm feeling dizzy and lightheaded.

242
00:15:53,125 --> 00:15:56,541
Let's end today's banquet here.

243
00:15:57,936 --> 00:16:00,890
I will take my leave first.

244
00:16:00,979 --> 00:16:03,240
(Eastern Palace)

245
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:07,600
Your Highness, I believe this young man is deeply scheming.

246
00:16:07,703 --> 00:16:10,020
Keeping him in the Censorate could be trouble.

247
00:16:10,127 --> 00:16:12,221
Vice Censor-in-Chief is absolutely right.

248
00:16:12,583 --> 00:16:14,260
Now that the Second Prince seeks talent,

249
00:16:14,341 --> 00:16:16,711
I believe Censor Shen should be allowed to go

250
00:16:16,792 --> 00:16:18,349
and serve at the Ministry of Revenue.

251
00:16:18,479 --> 00:16:21,000
That would also fulfill Your Highness's wish to support talent.

252
00:16:21,294 --> 00:16:22,451
Exactly.

253
00:16:22,532 --> 00:16:25,000
If His Majesty knew, he'd be pleased.

254
00:16:25,083 --> 00:16:27,120
He'd definitely be pleased.

255
00:16:27,263 --> 00:16:29,852
- I second that. - I second that.

256
00:16:30,098 --> 00:16:32,298
Gentlemen, what you said makes sense.

257
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:34,268
The Ministry of Revenue is understaffed right now,

258
00:16:34,292 --> 00:16:36,040
and the Yongtong Canal is a mess.

259
00:16:36,269 --> 00:16:37,919
It's perfect to send Shen Xiao over there

260
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,093
and let him carry out the grain-for-money policy.

261
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,981
When the grain runs out, and the canal collapses,

262
00:16:42,005 --> 00:16:43,640
he'll never be able to redeem himself.

263
00:16:43,863 --> 00:16:46,655
That way, we get rid of a major threat

264
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:50,036
and deal a heavy blow to Second Brother and the Ministry of Revenue.

265
00:16:50,158 --> 00:16:53,213
- That's right. - Princess Zhao Yang, you're absolutely right.

266
00:16:53,294 --> 00:16:55,497
- Exactly. - That makes sense.

267
00:17:00,766 --> 00:17:01,960
All right.

268
00:17:02,439 --> 00:17:03,653
Let him go.

269
00:17:04,638 --> 00:17:05,680
Yes.

270
00:17:05,761 --> 00:17:08,334
Your Highness is wise.

271
00:17:15,893 --> 00:17:18,560
You've gotten the transfer order as you wish.

272
00:17:44,298 --> 00:17:45,752
This is the Princess Residence.

273
00:17:54,708 --> 00:17:55,922
Your Highness.

274
00:17:56,622 --> 00:17:58,420
You got drunk and passed out on the floor.

275
00:17:58,542 --> 00:18:00,236
I'm the one who brought you back.

276
00:18:01,382 --> 00:18:03,116
I'm going to rest now.

277
00:18:18,292 --> 00:18:19,932
Who said you could take your clothes off?

278
00:18:22,994 --> 00:18:24,914
- Aren't we sleeping together? - Do we have to undress because of that?

279
00:18:24,938 --> 00:18:26,938
Put your clothes back on. Get in bed. Go to sleep.

280
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:45,240
So, your idea of sleeping together every night

281
00:18:45,321 --> 00:18:47,278
is just lying side by side like this?

282
00:18:47,359 --> 00:18:48,573
What else did you expect?

283
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:51,893
Do you really want to party every night, Top Scholar?

284
00:18:53,641 --> 00:18:54,951
I think...

285
00:18:55,032 --> 00:18:56,246
Shut up.

286
00:19:03,422 --> 00:19:04,480
Your Highness.

287
00:19:05,074 --> 00:19:08,849
If I manage to join the Ministry of Revenue

288
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,880
and end up in danger,

289
00:19:11,961 --> 00:19:13,440
will you protect me, Your Highness?

290
00:19:15,265 --> 00:19:16,479
No, I won't.

291
00:19:17,542 --> 00:19:19,560
Aren't you afraid you'll lose your pawn?

292
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:23,734
You're the one who wanted to go to the Ministry of Revenue.

293
00:19:23,758 --> 00:19:25,812
Your life is your own business.

294
00:19:26,448 --> 00:19:27,600
Quiet.

295
00:19:28,292 --> 00:19:29,865
I'm going to sleep.

296
00:20:32,174 --> 00:20:35,374
(Li Shu, you're really a calamity to me.)

297
00:20:50,283 --> 00:20:52,554
I, Zhao Yang, greet Your Majesty and wish you good health.

298
00:20:52,578 --> 00:20:54,922
I am not well.

299
00:20:56,125 --> 00:20:57,339
I'm anxious.

300
00:20:58,583 --> 00:20:59,797
Anxious?

301
00:21:00,321 --> 00:21:04,255
You seem so obedient on the surface,

302
00:21:04,833 --> 00:21:06,280
but you reached out

303
00:21:06,467 --> 00:21:10,921
to the Top Scholar from a poor background I personally appointed.
